WEBVTT

00:54:58.119 --> 00:55:01.268
and we don't know why we have
these extraordinary sensitivities

00:55:01.292 --> 00:55:03.947
and why we want to make art
and why we want to make love

00:55:03.971 --> 00:55:05.335
and why we want to make war.

00:55:05.359 --> 00:55:08.178
We don't know why we're so different
from every other thing

00:55:08.202 --> 00:55:09.879
that has ever lived on this planet,

00:55:09.903 --> 00:55:11.057
but we are.

00:55:11.081 --> 00:55:13.011
And it's a burden and it's a privilege,

00:55:13.035 --> 00:55:17.847
and I don't know think optimism
is changed by tragedy.

00:55:17.871 --> 00:55:21.812
I'm tremendously excited about my life.

00:55:21.836 --> 00:55:23.608
I'm thrilled about it.

00:55:23.632 --> 00:55:25.673
And I will also say this --

00:55:25.697 --> 00:55:29.140
and I want to say this very honestly,
because I want to dare people,

00:55:29.164 --> 00:55:31.245
when they go through their own grief,